UYAP Editor — License Status
============================

Upstream publishes no license terms for UYAP Editor. The Debian package
distributed by the Turkish Ministry of Justice (T.C. Adalet Bakanlığı)
at https://uyap.gov.tr/UYAP-Editor and https://rayp.adalet.gov.tr/ does
not include a LICENSE, COPYING, or equivalent file, and neither the
upstream download page nor the .deb control metadata declares a license.

This Arch Linux package (uyap-editor) is a binary redistribution of
the official upstream .deb. The redistribution terms, reverse-engineering
restrictions, and patent grants (if any) that apply to the included
bytecode are unknown to the packager.

The SPDX license identifier used in this package's PKGBUILD is
`LicenseRef-UYAP`, which is the SPDX-compliant way to reference a
license reference that does not correspond to a published SPDX identifier.

If you are the upstream author or rights holder and can clarify the
license of UYAP Editor, please contact the AUR maintainer so this
package can be updated with accurate metadata.
